REM EvilKey USB Tool Windows Notepad demo.
REM Press RUN on EvilKey while connected to your own unlocked Windows PC.
DELAY 1000
GUI m
DELAY 1000
GUI r
DELAY 1500
STRING notepad
ENTER
DELAY 3000
CTRL n
DELAY 400
REM The first device test dropped some characters at the default typing rate.
REM Jitter adds a short pause after every character, not just after each line.
$_JITTER_ENABLED = TRUE
$_JITTER_MAX = 120
DEFAULT_DELAY 80
STRING YOU HAVE BEEN HACKED
ENTER
STRING Relax. This key only opened Notepad.
ENTER
STRING The only data stolen was your attention.
ENTER
